    "title": "2026 WNBA Playoffs: Top 5 Defenders to Watch - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By W.G. Ramirez ,\n1 days ago The WNBA playoffs are often framed around scorers, but championship series can turn on the defender who erases an opponent’s first option, closes a driving lane or finishes a possession with a rebound. Offenses become more deliberate, rotations tighten and teams hunt perceived weaknesses. A defender who survives those searches can alter a series without shooting. Read full article",
